data: {"id": "f1337c1f6e99408d-thinking-parallel_evidence-2558", "run_id": "f1337c1f6e99408d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "很好！现在证据已采集完整。让我总结分析结果：\n\n---\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n**实体身份**：Pod `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b`（UID: `aa952049-8c4b-4522-92f6-9fad5f3fc865`），调度在 `node2`，container `app`。\n\n**当前状态**：\n- Pod phase: `Running`，但 container 状态 `CrashLoopBackOff`，`Ready=False`\n- restarts: 5次，最后 restart back-off 2m40s\n- Exit Code: 2，说明进程非正常退出\n\n**日志证据（时间窗 2026-09-07T12:30:27Z ~ 12:40:00Z）**：\n1. `2026-09-07T12:30:34Z`：HTTP GET `/work` 返回 200（info）\n2. `2026-09-07T12:30:36Z`：HTTP GET `/work` 返回 500，`\"runtime process exiting\"`（er", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 9, "ts_ms": 1788784534536, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

